# Briefing

Non-trivial work: load skill **`briefing-and-planning`** and post a brief before planning or code.

Plan-then-build: stronger model writes `plans/<slug>.md` (approved); cheaper model implements. See [docs/PLAN_THEN_BUILD.md](../../docs/PLAN_THEN_BUILD.md).

Trivial changes: say so in the PR; no plan file.